+# Two contract shapes:
+#   • With full row context (db + row_id): delegate to
+#     `assert_final_write_permitted` (single source of truth).
+#   • Without row context AND `allow_writes_without_row=True`
+#     (probes / migration / cleanup): permit but LOG loudly for
